ModerationService --> ListingsService
OrganizationReviewService --> OrganizationsService
EventsService --> EventsRepository
EventsService --> OrganizationsRepository
EventsService --> VenuesRepository
EventsService --> CategoriesService
EventSessionsService --> EventsRepository
EventSessionsService --> EventSessionsRepository
CategoriesService --> CategoriesRepository
OrganizationsService --> OrganizationsRepository
ImportFreshnessService --> ImportRunsRepository
ListingsService --> ListingsRepository
ListingsService --> CategoriesService
ListingsService --> EventsService
ListingsService --> ProfilesService
EventsService --> TransactionRunner
EventsService --> JobQueue
ApplicationsService --> ApplicationsRepository
ApplicationsService --> EventSessionsService
ApplicationsService --> ProfilesService
ApplicationsService --> MatchingService
ApplicationsService --> TransactionRunner
MatchingService --> MatchesRepository
MatchingService --> ApplicationsRepository
MatchingService --> EventSessionsService
MatchingService --> ProfilesService
MatchingService --> ModerationService
MatchingService --> TransactionRunner
MatchingService --> JobQueue
MatchesService --> MatchesRepository
MatchesService --> EventSessionsService
MatchesService --> ProfilesService
MatchesService --> TransactionRunner
EventChangesService --> JobQueue
EventChangesService --> TransactionRunner
EventChangesService --> EventSessionsService
EventChangesService --> ApplicationsRepository
EventChangesService --> MatchesRepository
EventChangesService --> MatchingService
EventChangesService --> NotificationsService
StatsService --> EventsService
StatsService --> MatchingService

legend right
  Solid arrow: calls (constructor injection)
  Dashed arrow: implements
  ESLint rejects any other import across these boxes
  Abstract classes (italic) are implemented in infra: see code-structure-infra
  Grey boxes: classes of other modules, shown with their methods on their own diagram
endlegend

@enduml
